# - University thesis on French Caribbean dancehall, theses.fr record 2013AGUY0728 (search result, 2026-10-20): names the Gaza girls crew in Guadeloupe and the Martinique portmanteau Volgaza as adoptions of the word Gaza. It never names a Gaza Crew: used here as negative evidence and to explain the vocabulary of the period.
